DESCRIPTION >
    Alerts: AI-source pageview traffic, trailing 7d, grouped by platform.
    Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of
    api/routes/alerts.js:81 (queryName 'alert_ai'). Typed-column translation:
    properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type, properties.ai_source ->
    ai_source (typed, LowCardinality(String) Nullable per §2.6). No JSON-bag
    fields. IDENTICAL query text to integ_ai.pipe
    (api/routes/integrations.js:145) — duplicate logic, Phase-6 consolidation
    candidate (noted, not acted on).
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE alert_ai_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT ai_source, count() AS cnt
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND ai_source IS NOT NULL
      AND ai_source != ''
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 7 DAY
    GROUP BY ai_source
    ORDER BY cnt DESC
    LIMIT 10

TYPE endpoint
